1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
The NTSB has investigated more than 154,000 aviation accidents.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,700
They have issued more than 15,700 safety recommendations.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,900
Eighty-two percent of the closed recommendations were actually implemented.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,900
In 2025 alone, they adopted 1,436 investigative reports.

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,900
That is eighteen percent more than 2024.

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,900
They issued 131 new safety recommendations.

7
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,900
Fourteen of them were marked urgent.

8
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:16,150
As one observer put it: I wish more industries treated their mistakes the same way the aviation industry and our NTSB does.

